  "helpScreenTitle": "Help",
  "faqOrderTripQuestion": "How do I request a trip?",
  "faqOrderTripAnswer": "From the home screen, set your pickup point then choose your destination, then check the suggested price and send the request. You'll receive offers from nearby drivers and can choose the one that suits you.",
  "faqPricingQuestion": "How is the price determined?",
  "faqPricingAnswer": "The price is calculated based on the actual distance between the pickup point and the destination. You can raise or lower the suggested price while negotiating with drivers.",
  "faqPaymentMethodsQuestion": "What payment methods are available?",
  "faqPaymentMethodsAnswer": "You can pay cash directly to the driver, through the e-wallet, or via InstaPay. You can choose the payment method while confirming the request.",
  "faqNoAcceptQuestion": "No one is accepting my request, what should I do?",
  "faqNoAcceptAnswer": "Try raising the price a bit while negotiating, especially during peak times or in remote areas — this makes the request more appealing to nearby drivers.",
  "faqBecomeDriverQuestion": "How do I become a driver on the Tayar app?",
  "faqBecomeDriverAnswer": "From the side menu, choose \"Driver Mode\" and complete the registration steps (personal info, license, motorcycle). After review, you'll be able to receive requests.",
  "faqDriverEarningsQuestion": "How are driver earnings calculated?",
  "faqDriverEarningsAnswer": "For each trip, the driver gets 90% of the trip value, while the company takes 10% for running the platform. You can track your earnings details from the \"Income\" tab.",
  "faqDeliverPackageQuestion": "Can I deliver a package instead of doing a passenger trip?",
  "faqDeliverPackageAnswer": "Yes, through the \"Package Delivery\" service you can send a package from one place to another without being present for the trip. The same negotiation system applies here too.",
  "faqTripProblemQuestion": "What should I do if a problem occurs during a trip?",
  "faqTripProblemAnswer": "You can contact our support team directly from the \"Support\" screen in the side menu, and we'll help you resolve the issue right away.",

